    {\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Risk and deposit-comparison restrictions remain separate advertising controls.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"DEFERRED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u23\\\"},\\n    {\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Monitoring and possible regulatory action do not establish a commencement date or automatic sanction.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u24\\\"},\\n    {\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Institutional attribution.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u25\\\"},\\n    {\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Institutional attribution.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u26\\\"},\\n    {\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Institutional attribution.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"CONTEXT\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u27\\\"},\\n    {\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Footnote identifies offering-document requirements; full Handbook provision is unavailable.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"DEFERRED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u28\\\"},\\n    {\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Identifies the Code’s title, including licensed and registered persons; full applicability provisions remain unavailable.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"INTERPRETED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u29\\\"},\\n    {\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Identifies the FAQ and its issue date, but the answer itself is absent.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"DEFERRED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u30\\\"},\\n    {\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Unspecified evolving advertising supplements cannot be resolved from this packet.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"DEFERRED\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u31\\\"}\\n  ],\\n  \\\"dimensions\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"dimension\\\":\\\"scope\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"The selected control addresses distributors promoting a specific investment product or particular product type to a client. The circular concerns SFC-authorised funds; its opening reference to licensed corporations does not conclusively exclude registered intermediaries. Public advertising, online distribution and guaranteed returns are not necessary triggers.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u1\\\",\\\"u13\\\",\\\"u14\\\",\\\"u29\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"PROPOSED\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"dimension\\\":\\\"definitions\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"Distributors are identified as intermediaries distributing these funds. Gift and discount are not exhaustively defined. Additional returns or incentives may qualify as gifts, rather than necessarily doing so. Product types expressly include certain fund types and funds from certain fund houses.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u1\\\",\\\"u8\\\",\\\"u13\\\",\\\"u14\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"dimension\\\":\\\"exceptions\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"The discount parenthesis qualifies gifts under the selected control, including gifts linked to a product type. Whether eligible fees must relate to that promoted product is unresolved. Section 103 authorisation or exemption is not stated to excuse the gift restriction.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u10\\\",\\\"u13\\\",\\\"u14\\\",\\\"u15\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"dimension\\\":\\\"modality\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"The source states that distributors 'should not' offer gifts and calls this a requirement. The formalizations identify offers caught by that stated restriction; they do not determine a criminal offence, sanction, or overall compliance. 'May be considered a gift' leaves classification unresolved.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u10\\\",\\\"u13\\\",\\\"u14\\\",\\\"u24\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"PROPOSED\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"dimension\\\":\\\"time\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"No circular commencement date or transition period is supplied. The 30 September 2010 date identifies the referenced FAQ’s issuance, not the selected control’s effective date. Applicable versions cannot be determined from the packet.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u30\\\",\\\"u31\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"dimension\\\":\\\"dependencies\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"Paragraph 3.11 and FAQ question 1 are the principal unresolved authorities. Section 103 is a separate dependency; the Handbook, paragraph 2.3 and advertising guidance concern surrounding controls. The external-authorities dependency has no supplied text or hash, so no additional content is inferred.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u7\\\",\\\"u10\\\",\\\"u12\\\",\\\"u14\\\",\\\"u21\\\",\\\"u22\\\",\\\"u28\\\",\\\"u29\\\",\\\"u30\\\",\\\"u31\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [\\n    \\\"Does paragraph 3.11 or FAQ question 1 restrict the discount exception to fees or charges associated with the promoted investment product?\\\",\\n    \\\"What distinguishes a genuine fee discount from a cash rebate, top-up return or other gift under the applicable authorities?\\\",\\n    \\\"Which Code and FAQ versions apply at the time of the assessed offer, and what are their commencement provisions?\\\",\\n    \\\"What do the full applicability provisions establish about licensed and registered distributors and promotion beyond SFC-authorised funds?\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"readings\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"assumptions\\\":[\\n        \\\"The assessment concerns one offered benefit in a distributor’s promotion of SFC-authorised funds.\\\",\\n        \\\"A genuine discount can be treated as excepted even where it otherwise falls within the assessed gift category.\\\",\\n        \\\"The unqualified words 'fees or charges' do not require those fees to relate to the promoted product.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"citations\\\":[\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"Intermediaries who distribute these funds (distributors)\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u1\\\"},\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"distributors should not offer any gifts (other than a discount of fees or charges) in promoting a specific investment product or a particular type of investment product to a client.\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u14\\\"},\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"such as certain types of funds or funds offered by certain fund houses\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u14\\\"},\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"as they may be considered a gift that should not be offered to investors.\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u13\\\"}\\n      ],\\n      \\\"distinction\\\":\\\"On this textual reading, a genuine discount on another service’s fees can fall within the exception even when used to promote a fund. This gives the unqualified exception broader reach than the product-related reading.\\\",\\n      \\\"family\\\":\\\"exceptions\\\",\\n      \\\"formalization\\\":{\\n        \\\"facts\\\":[\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed actor is an intermediary distributing SFC-authorised funds in the assessed activity.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"is_distributor\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u1\\\",\\\"u29\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"Boolean\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed benefit is offered to a client in promotion of a specific fund or particular fund type, including a linkage to funds of certain fund houses.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"has_product_promotion_connection\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"Boolean\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed benefit is offered and qualifies as a gift before applying the fee-discount exception; an additional return is not automatically classified as a gift.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"gift_offered\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u13\\\",\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"Boolean\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed benefit genuinely constitutes a discount of fees or charges, irrespective of which service those fees concern.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"is_fee_discount\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"Boolean\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The fees or charges discounted by the assessed benefit relate to the promoted investment product or product type.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"discount_relates_to_promoted_product\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"Boolean\\\"}\\n        ],\\n        \\\"result\\\":\\\"(and gift_offered (not is_fee_discount))\\\",\\n        \\\"result_type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\n        \\\"scope\\\":\\\"(and is_distributor has_product_promotion_connection)\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"local_id\\\":\\\"r1\\\",\\n      \\\"questions\\\":[\\n        \\\"Does the missing FAQ confirm that discounts on unrelated services remain within the exception?\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"statement\\\":\\\"Selected control: paragraph-10 gift-promotion restriction, with an unqualified fee-discount exception. Within scope, an offered gift is caught unless it is a genuine discount of fees or charges. A true result identifies an offer caught by this selected restriction only.\\\",\\n      \\\"subject\\\":\\\"Breadth of the fee-discount exception\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"assumptions\\\":[\\n        \\\"The assessment concerns one offered benefit in a distributor’s promotion of SFC-authorised funds.\\\",\\n        \\\"A genuine discount can be treated as excepted even where it otherwise falls within the assessed gift category.\\\",\\n        \\\"The surrounding product-promotion language implicitly confines the discount exception to fees or charges relating to that product; this qualification is not express.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"citations\\\":[\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"other than a discount of fees or charges\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u14\\\"},\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"in promoting a specific investment product or a particular type of investment product to a client.\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u14\\\"},\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"The purpose of the requirement is to avoid the use of gifts to distract investors from the features and risks of a particular product.\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u14\\\"},\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"3 The answer to question 1 of the frequently asked questions on the Code of Conduct issued by the SFC on 30 September 2010.\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u30\\\"}\\n      ],\\n      \\\"distinction\\\":\\\"On this contextual reading, a discount on unrelated service fees remains caught if it qualifies as a gift linked to fund promotion. The anti-distraction purpose supports the narrower exception, but the absence of an express product-related qualifier is its strongest weakness.\\\",\\n      \\\"family\\\":\\\"exceptions\\\",\\n      \\\"formalization\\\":{\\n        \\\"facts\\\":[\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed actor is an intermediary distributing SFC-authorised funds in the assessed activity.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"is_distributor\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u1\\\",\\\"u29\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"Boolean\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed benefit is offered to a client in promotion of a specific fund or particular fund type, including a linkage to funds of certain fund houses.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"has_product_promotion_connection\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"Boolean\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed benefit is offered and qualifies as a gift before applying the fee-discount exception; an additional return is not automatically classified as a gift.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"gift_offered\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u13\\\",\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"Boolean\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed benefit genuinely constitutes a discount of fees or charges, irrespective of which service those fees concern.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"is_fee_discount\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"Boolean\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The fees or charges discounted by the assessed benefit relate to the promoted investment product or product type.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"discount_relates_to_promoted_product\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"Boolean\\\"}\\n        ],\\n        \\\"result\\\":\\\"(and gift_offered (not (and is_fee_discount discount_relates_to_promoted_product)))\\\",\\n        \\\"result_type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\n        \\\"scope\\\":\\\"(and is_distributor has_product_promotion_connection)\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"local_id\\\":\\\"r2\\\",\\n      \\\"questions\\\":[\\n        \\\"Does the full Code or FAQ supply the product-related limitation that this contextual reading implies?\\\",\\n        \\\"Would account-level or platform-wide fee discounts count as relating to the promoted product?\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"statement\\\":\\\"Selected control: paragraph-10 gift-promotion restriction, with a product-related fee-discount exception. Within scope, an offered gift is caught unless it is a genuine discount of fees or charges relating to the promoted product or product type. A true result identifies an offer caught by this selected restriction only.\\\",\\n      \\\"subject\\\":\\\"Breadth of the fee-discount exception\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"}}\n{\"type\":\"turn.completed\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":28221,\"cached_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_write_input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":3084,\"reasoning_output_tokens\":106}}\n","fresh_context":true,"independence":"CONTEXT_ONLY_SAME_MODEL_CORRELATION_UNMEASURED","model":"gpt-6-astra","provider":"codex.fresh.v1","provider_route_hash":"3d676052ff208f9c0b35467659af41d3138476127d0d1b523970689c2edf4714","request_hash":"dd0d063abe5135ca6e5e82dc5b20320907ccfc